1
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:08,280
Portrait or landscape?

2
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:09,600
How about this?

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Let's invite Xing in.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:12,960
(Inviting Xing in)
We're the security.

5
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:13,840
We're the security.

6
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,920
Meng, can you move back....

7
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:17,480
Move back a little?

8
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,360
Yeah, a little farther back.

9
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:21,320
All right. Three, two, one.

10
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:23,800
That looks great.

11
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:26,440
One more.

12
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:27,480
One more?

13
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,280
Okay.

14
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,400
That came out so good.

15
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,360
It looks really good.

16
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:33,640
Pick one

17
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:34,520
and give it to me.

18
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,320
You pick.

19
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,760
I think this one looks sweeter.

20
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,000
Then let's send the sweet one.

21
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:39,320
Okay.

22
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:40,720
Go ahead. We won't keep you.

23
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:41,240
Okay.

24
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:41,600
Go on.

25
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:42,160
Go, go.

26
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:42,720
Okay.

27
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:44,880
This is for you.

28
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:46,000
Take one every night

29
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,600
before bed.

30
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,320
What is it?

31
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,400
Just vitamins.

32
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,440
I think they've actually helped
a little.

33
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:52,600
Like, you sleep better?

34
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:56,200
Maybe. You might look a little
more refreshed too.

35
00:00:58,840 --> 00:00:59,680
Come here.

36
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:00,600
Let's take a picture.

37
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,800
We'll send one of you two
to the hospital too.

38
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,240
Come on.

39
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:02,760
Sure.

40
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:03,920
Yeah, let's take one together.

41
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:06,120
Then we'll...

42
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:06,960
You guys stand here.

43
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:07,840
Okay.

44
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,800
This spot looks great.

45
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:09,640
Yeah, right here.

46
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,320
This archway looks good.

47
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:12,000
Just stand right there.

48
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:12,760
Here?

49
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:13,800
Yeah.

50
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:16,360
How should we pose?

51
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:17,600
Let's just...

52
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:19,320
Do this?

53
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:19,680
Like this?

54
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:20,720
Perfect.

55
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:22,280
Okay.

56
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,560
Yeah, just like that.

57
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:27,440
Three, two, one.

58
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,160
That's a good one.

59
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,360
The pink looks really nice.

60
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,520
Not bad. Look.

61
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,480
Whoa.

62
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,000
Let's take one more.

63
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,320
One for the hospital

64
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,040
and one for yourselves.

65
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:37,840
Then let's not cover our faces.

66
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:38,520
Okay.

67
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:42,480
Three, two, one.

68
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:44,720
This one's pretty good.

69
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:45,680
Nice.

70
00:01:46,960 --> 00:01:47,800
Okay.

71
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:49,120
Thanks.

72
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:49,600
Sure.

73
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,080
Pick one to send to the hospital.

74
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:52,640
Okay, we'll pick one.

75
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:52,960
Okay.

76
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:53,760
Thanks, Meng.

77
00:01:55,190 --> 00:01:55,760
Okay.

78
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:57,720
We'll head upstairs and grab some stuff.

79
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:58,600
Okay.

80
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,680
I'll run upstairs.

81
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:02,560
Look at this.

82
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,840
(Bruise)
How'd you get that?

83
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:08,040
I slipped coming out of the bathroom.

84
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:12,240
Does it hurt when you walk?

85
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,160
No.

86
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:15,280
When did it happen?

87
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:17,600
The day before yesterday.

88
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:20,360
Or maybe three days ago.

89
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,760
Why didn't you tell me?

90
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:23,880
(Worried)

91
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:26,680
I forgot. I actually just noticed it.

92
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,600
I was wearing long skirts,
so I didn't see it.

93
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:31,080
Don't worry. I'm fine.

94
00:02:32,760 --> 00:02:34,480
I went straight down onto my knees.

95
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,160
One knee?

96
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,480
I don't even remember.

97
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,760
It happened so fast.

98
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:43,160
(Looks)
I didn't even have time to process it.

99
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:44,080
I was already on the floor.

100
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,160
Did you put anything on it?

101
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:45,720
Like...

102
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:46,200
No need.

103
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:46,800
Spray?

104
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,720
I don't think I need it.

105
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:48,920
It's fine. It's already getting better.

106
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:50,640
It doesn't hurt at all?

107
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:51,440
No.

108
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,600
Just a little if I press on it.

109
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,560
Otherwise, it doesn't hurt.

110
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:03,420
(Tosses)

111
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,040
If there were a hoop here,

112
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,200
we could shoot baskets.

113
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,200
Here?

114
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:08,240
Have you ever

115
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:10,280
played basketball before?

116
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,480
A little.

117
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:12,280
Oh, you have?

118
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,640
For a while,

119
00:03:14,640 --> 00:03:15,320
I stopped running at night

120
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,360
and started shooting hoops instead.

121
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,200
Xing and I

122
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:18,920
would go shoot around.

123
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,640
Whose idea was it?

124
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:23,560
I don't even remember.

125
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,760
We kind of came up with it together

126
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:26,200
because we happened to see

127
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:27,520
a basketball court

128
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,640
near our place.

129
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:32,040
(Points)
There's something up there too.

130
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:32,600
Where?

131
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:33,600
Up...

132
00:03:33,600 --> 00:03:34,680
on the roof.

133
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,160
Yeah.

134
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,400
You can actually climb
all the way up there?

135
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:37,360
No.

136
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:38,360
That's for ringing the bell.

137
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:41,080
That's a bell? I thought it was a light.

138
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:41,560
Nope.

139
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:42,400
(Amused)
It's a bell.

140
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,360
How are you supposed to reach it?

141
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,720
Let me try.

142
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:49,000
How long do you think it'll take me?

143
00:03:50,960 --> 00:03:53,280
At your pace? Maybe twenty seconds.

144
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:54,760
Twenty?

145
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:57,320
Okay, I'll count.

146
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:58,600
You're timing me?

147
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,680
Do you have a timer?

148
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,040
Or...

149
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:03,800
Take mine.

150
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:06,020
(Takes off his watch)

151
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:06,640
Okay.

152
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,880
Tell me when you're ready.

153
00:04:10,480 --> 00:04:11,280
I'm ready.

154
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:12,960
Three.

155
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,600
Two.

156
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,200
One.

157
00:04:17,520 --> 00:04:19,320
(Concerned)
Be careful.

158
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,360
Okay.

159
00:04:23,060 --> 00:04:25,420
(Laughs)

160
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:28,040
Fifteen, sixteen... I think.

161
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,240
Around there.

162
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:30,880
Sixteen, seventeen.

163
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:31,600
Seventeen?

164
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,280
Can you get down?

165
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,200
Let me see.

166
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:47,240
Move back a little.

167
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,040
I'll just jump down.

168
00:04:50,080 --> 00:04:51,400
Want me to catch you?

169
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,040
I don't think...

170
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,640
you'd be able to.

171
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:55,120
Then

172
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,240
jump this way.

173
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,440
Let me see how to do this.

174
00:04:58,080 --> 00:04:59,120
Back up a little.

175
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,640
(Concerned)
Just don't hit the wall.

176
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,080
Okay, here goes.

177
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,040
That was actually kind of fun.

178
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,640
(Laughs)
Wasn't that scary?

179
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:11,560
(Teasing)
I was terrified.

180
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,400
I would never do that.

181
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:17,200
That had to be at least two meters.

182
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,120
Yeah, about that.

183
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:21,200
Would you ever go bungee jumping?

184
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:22,480
Probably not.

185
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,160
Probably not?

186
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,400
Have you ever tried it?

187
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:27,200
That two-meter jump

188
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:28,320
was already...

189
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:30,360
about my limit.

190
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,640
Let's find a spot.

191
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:43,120
Which do you like more,

192
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:45,040
rock climbing or playing sports?

193
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,480
What sports?

194
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,320
Badminton.

195
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,320
Badminton?

196
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,120
Which one do you like more?

197
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,640
Yeah, which one?

198
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,720
Probably badminton.

199
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:01,600
What other sports

200
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,640
do you like?

201
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:05,440
Cycling and tennis.

202
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:06,640
But tennis and badminton

203
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:07,680
are kind of similar.

204
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,480
Then let's try badminton.

205
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,360
Let's go.

206
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:12,800
Okay.

207
00:06:13,660 --> 00:06:14,380
(Pulls)

208
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:17,340
(Pulls)

209
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:22,360
The shuttlecock's up there.

210
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:22,960
You go first.

211
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:23,800
Watch your step.

212
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:37,360
So you've pretty much tried

213
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,640
everything here now.

214
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:41,000
Yeah.

215
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:42,560
What...

216
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,840
what haven't you tried yet?

217
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:44,960
The treadmill.

218
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:46,160
You haven't tried that either?

219
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:48,600
Ready?

220
00:06:54,060 --> 00:06:54,940
(Misses)

221
00:07:05,040 --> 00:07:05,680
My bad.

222
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,520
Here, take the watch.

223
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:12,560
Heavy?

224
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,720
Throwing you off?

225
00:07:14,780 --> 00:07:15,700
(Laughs)

226
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,120
Yeah, it's heavy.

227
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:30,640
You could take the watch off.

228
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:31,960
It's fine.

229
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:33,480
I'll just leave it here.

230
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,560
Point for me.

231
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,400
Your aim is good.

232
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,180
(Laughs)

233
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,080
Nice.

234
00:07:58,140 --> 00:07:59,100
(Compliments)

235
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:01,280
That was a bit much.

236
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:02,400
I hit it too hard.

237
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:04,360
It was like you were swatting a fly.

238
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,720
You're so accurate.
You make it look so easy.

239
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:14,160
Do you usually hit it that far?

240
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:16,400
Yeah, I hit it out a lot.

241
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:18,700
(Turns around)

242
00:08:18,780 --> 00:08:19,560
(Moves farther back)

243
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,480
I'll move back then.

244
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:24,680
Oh, bringing out the big guns now?

245
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:26,480
Let me try. Maybe...

246
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,160
It's okay. I'll hit it back to you.

247
00:08:44,540 --> 00:08:45,780
(Hits it wide)

248
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,000
You did that on purpose.

249
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,160
No, I just missed.

250
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:50,160
You hit it straight into the grass.

251
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:51,080
That really was an accident.

252
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:54,700
(Hits it wide again)

253
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:58,120
That one was on purpose too.

254
00:09:01,280 --> 00:09:02,240
Nice shot!

255
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,940
(Joking)
I'll give you one, Cui.

256
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:11,320
No thanks, I'm good.

257
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,160
You guys...

258
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:18,640
We're good.

259
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:21,000
We're just looking around.

260
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:22,760
Just wandering around.

261
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:31,040
Are you cold?

262
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:32,360
There are blankets here.

263
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,400
This will do.

264
00:09:35,640 --> 00:09:36,840
I'll show you how to fall.

265
00:09:37,580 --> 00:09:38,360
(Rock climbing)

266
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,040
Come on.

267
00:09:39,040 --> 00:09:40,400
I can go down there too, right?

268
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,400
Of course.

269
00:09:42,380 --> 00:09:44,900
(Waits)

270
00:09:46,780 --> 00:09:48,900
(Protects her)

271
00:09:49,660 --> 00:09:50,540
(Holds on tight)

272
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:51,800
It's so soft down here.

273
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:53,120
Yeah.

274
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,240
This is so fun.

275
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:55,160
So you just drop down from up there

276
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:56,320
and land down here.

277
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,840
That actually looks kind of fun.

278
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,560
Yeah.

279
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,360
Okay, I'm going up.

280
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,680
Go for it.

281
00:10:03,860 --> 00:10:04,820
(Watches closely)

282
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,560
What if

283
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:07,400
I accidentally fall?

284
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:10,960
I'll catch you.

285
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:14,240
This looks harder than I thought.

286
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:21,920
That fast?

287
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:22,520
Yeah.

288
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:24,120
Once you get up there,
you ring the bell.

289
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,480
So once you ring it,

290
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,560
you're done?

291
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:27,480
Yeah.

292
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:28,440
Just ring the bell.

293
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:31,360
And then?

294
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,680
Then you just fall down.

295
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:34,520
Wait, let me move.

296
00:10:36,160 --> 00:10:37,040
I'll get out of the way.

297
00:10:40,780 --> 00:10:42,420
(Watches)

298
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,040
Come on.

299
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,600
Okay, here I go.

300
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:50,840
Yeah.

301
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,960
That's how my hair got so messy.

302
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:56,680
But it actually looks good like that.

303
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:02,480
Nice.

304
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:04,760
Earlier today, I was hanging onto

305
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:07,800
that rope forever.

306
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:12,000
Did that hurt your hands?

307
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,220
(Concerned)

308
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:14,680
No.

309
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:16,520
The rope just felt

310
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:17,480
a little rough.

311
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,120
I had gloves on, though.

312
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,320
Gloves?

313
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:21,400
Let me see

314
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:23,080
how I can sit nicely.

315
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:24,760
Here, I'll put one under you.

316
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:25,840
Like...

317
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,160
Put it underneath like this.

318
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:28,280
I'll sit here.

319
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:30,960
Okay, this is good.

320
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:34,320
Let's bury you in these.

321
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,080
Okay.

322
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:42,400
Bury me and take a picture.

323
00:11:43,520 --> 00:11:45,000
(Places it down)
We should've brought the camera over.

324
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,460
(Places it down)
Yeah.

325
00:11:51,620 --> 00:11:53,060
(Piles them on)

326
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,700
(Covered)
What are you doing?

327
00:11:54,740 --> 00:11:56,340
(Gently places it down)

328
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,960
Nice and warm?

329
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:01,560
A little too warm.

330
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:05,160
Definitely a little too warm.

331
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:06,840
I'd say very warm.

332
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:16,880
Take that.

333
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:23,000
They're here.

334
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:24,720
Hi.

335
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:25,320
Join us!

336
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,080
Hi.

337
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:27,680
This is so comfortable.

338
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,160
I tried it.

339
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,200
Alright then.

340
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,040
I won't ask again.

341
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,400
You can take a break here.

342
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:35,200
Okay.

343
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,000
This is quite comfortable.

344
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:47,600
I'l feeling sleepy.

345
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:52,280
Actually, most couches

346
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:53,920
use this type of sponge.

347
00:12:53,920 --> 00:12:56,040
I'll build a throne for you.

348
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:57,440
A throne?

349
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,240
Yes.

350
00:12:58,760 --> 00:13:01,040
Didn't you already build me one?

351
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:02,560
There's one more?

352
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:03,440
That's a couch.

353
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,520
This is a throne.

354
00:13:04,520 --> 00:13:05,680
Couch?

355
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:10,680
This is so funny.

356
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:12,000
You got this.

357
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,360
Cui,

358
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:18,840
I have comments.

359
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:19,360
Cui,

360
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:21,120
are you going to stack it all up?

361
00:13:22,040 --> 00:13:23,560
He's building a staircase
all the way up there.

362
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:24,680
I'm building a throne.

363
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:26,320
And you'll step on it?

364
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,240
Yeah.

365
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:28,100
My gosh.

366
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:30,960
Okay. I'll help out.

367
00:13:30,960 --> 00:13:32,320
You'll sit facing each other.

368
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:39,880
Take a seat.

369
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,840
Is that it?

370
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:44,640
Hang on.

371
00:13:44,700 --> 00:13:45,560
(Finishing touches)

372
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:46,360
Backrest.

373
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,760
Won't this fall?

374
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:49,520
Sit.

375
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:50,760
Won't this fall?

376
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:57,520
You could sink right in.

377
00:13:58,160 --> 00:13:59,080
It'll sink.

378
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:00,240
It'll sink?

379
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,600
I only just sat down.

380
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,080
(Slides)
It's collapsing.

381
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:07,040
You'll have to tough it out.

382
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:11,120
The bottom collapsed.

383
00:14:14,040 --> 00:14:15,280
Why did the throne fall?

384
00:14:15,920 --> 00:14:16,840
I sat on it.

385
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:19,360
This throne isn't meant for sitting.

386
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,120
Do you understand?

387
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:21,520
I'll build a stable one.

388
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:26,720
Okay.

389
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,400
Let me try this.

390
00:14:28,400 --> 00:14:30,200
Gently.

391
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:35,120
It can work.

392
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:36,720
Hang on.

393
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:39,640
It works.

394
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:40,520
I'm relaxed.

395
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:41,680
Look at my legs.

396
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:43,080
Look at me.

397
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:45,360
(No problem)
Move gently.

398
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:47,120
The back is falling.

399
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:48,080
Move gentler.

400
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:51,600
I've sat long enough on this.

401
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:53,640
Because it can't go any lower.

402
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:55,120
Mine is more stable.

403
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:56,040
It sunk to the very bottom.

404
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:57,720
You're just pretending now.

405
00:14:57,740 --> 00:14:59,180
(Pretending)

406
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:00,680
This is quite fun.

407
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:01,560
Done?

408
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:02,320
I'm done.

409
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:03,400
It...

410
00:15:03,400 --> 00:15:04,360
Yours look...

411
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:05,160
A little...

412
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:06,480
Not too bad.

413
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,960
(Praise)
It looks quite stable.

414
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:10,360
Wait.

415
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:11,920
Let me reinforce this for you.

416
00:15:12,580 --> 00:15:13,320
(Tries sitting down)

417
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,280
I only have...

418
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:15,000
This is a little...

419
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:22,080
I know the problem now.

420
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,080
I need another layer.

421
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,280
Si just keeps going lower

422
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:26,680
(Laughs)
and lower.

423
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:27,800
I need one more layer.

424
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:31,260
(Fixing it immediately)

425
00:15:32,700 --> 00:15:34,940
(Tries sitting down again)

426
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:35,960
Is it better now?

427
00:15:36,880 --> 00:15:38,340
Yes.

428
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:40,520
(Slides)
She's also hanging in there.

429
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:42,440
She says it's better

430
00:15:42,440 --> 00:15:44,160
but keeps sliding down.

431
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:46,960
So funny.

432
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:52,120
Let's go to the balcony.

433
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,280
Okay.

434
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:54,680
So many mosquitoes.

435
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:56,880
Should we get
the mosquito-repellent bracelet?

436
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:57,760
I have them.

437
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:58,560
Okay.

438
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:01,480
I have something fun too.

439
00:16:03,040 --> 00:16:03,960
What is it?

440
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:05,880
What did you buy?

441
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:09,280
Journey to the West.

442
00:16:10,480 --> 00:16:11,280
Cartoons.

443
00:16:11,760 --> 00:16:13,880
Yeah. I just watched whatever
was on the TV.

444
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,320
Like Journey to the West.

445
00:16:17,280 --> 00:16:18,640
So you like that show.

446
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:20,600
I really wanted it when I was younger.

447
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:24,320
Let's read.

448
00:16:25,440 --> 00:16:27,200
It's a pop-up book.

449
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:28,520
A pop-up book?

450
00:16:31,500 --> 00:16:33,600
(Pop-up comic)
A visual feast.

451
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:34,560
Stunning.

452
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:36,720
They're fighting.

453
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,640
Barge into the Heavenly Palace.

454
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:38,720
Wreak havoc in the Heavenly Palace.

455
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:40,360
This is so fast-paced.

456
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:40,800
Is it?

457
00:16:40,800 --> 00:16:41,680
He barged right in.

458
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:42,280
Concentrate.

459
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,360
Defeating the White Bone Spirit.

460
00:16:45,800 --> 00:16:46,720
Do you remember this?

461
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:47,600
Yeah.

462
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:49,720
He killed the spirits.

463
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:50,720
The White Bone Spirit.

464
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,640
White Bone Spirit.

465
00:16:51,640 --> 00:16:52,960
Thank you.

466
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:53,700
(Imitates tone)

467
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,080
Thank you.

468
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:57,700
(Imitates)

469
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:58,800
Thank you.

470
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:01,320
You imitate it so well.

471
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,640
You're the White Bone Spirit.

472
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:04,720
You are the White Bone Spirit.

473
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:05,600
No, you.

474
00:17:05,600 --> 00:17:06,400
Are you Tang Seng?

475
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,120
I am.

476
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:10,120
Danger.

477
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:11,360
Put this on.

478
00:17:13,320 --> 00:17:14,360
Stick this on.

479
00:17:14,360 --> 00:17:16,000
What color should I wear?

480
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:16,840
What about blue?

481
00:17:16,840 --> 00:17:17,840
Matches your shirt.

482
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:18,440
Okay.

483
00:17:19,120 --> 00:17:20,160
Putting an outfit together.

484
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:20,960
Here.

485
00:17:22,540 --> 00:17:24,200
(Reaches his hand out)
Which side is the front?

486
00:17:24,200 --> 00:17:25,000
Doesn't matter.

487
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:35,580
(Sticks it on)

488
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:38,480
It's a little bear today.

489
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:39,080
Little bear.

490
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:40,200
Like a capybara.

491
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:41,400
Cabababa

492
00:17:41,500 --> 00:17:43,260
(Playful)
Abababa.

493
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:45,880
Cababara.

494
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:47,520
Capybaba.

495
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:48,740
(Imitates)

496
00:17:53,560 --> 00:17:55,040
I want to bring the guitar up here.

497
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:55,880
Okay.

498
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:06,000
Here. I'll calibrate it for you first.

499
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:07,520
What do you want?

500
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:08,280
Which song do you want to sing?

501
00:18:08,760 --> 00:18:12,300
Quick. Sing the first sentence.

502
00:18:12,300 --> 00:18:12,800
(Wants to hear)

503
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:15,640
(Sings immediately)
♪My darling, let me tell you♪

504
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:18,720
♪I've got a mischievous side or two♪

505
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:20,280
♪My darling♪

506
00:18:24,420 --> 00:18:28,860
(Helping to tune the guitar)

507
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:33,280
Let's bring it up.

508
00:18:33,280 --> 00:18:34,560
We'll play in the garden.

509
00:18:35,360 --> 00:18:37,440
(Cupping hand around mouth)
How about we go play in the garden?

510
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:38,200
Sure!

511
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:39,440
Did you hear me?

512
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,240
Go.

513
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,040
Let's go.

514
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:43,560
Okay.

515
00:18:47,260 --> 00:18:48,220
(Walking accompaniment)

516
00:18:55,360 --> 00:19:01,680
♪What's gone will never return♪

517
00:19:02,520 --> 00:19:03,280
I'll sit here.

518
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:05,480
How is it?

519
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:06,520
Done tuning?

520
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:07,520
Of course.

521
00:19:07,820 --> 00:19:09,280
(Laughs)

522
00:19:09,280 --> 00:19:10,320
You should sing.

523
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:11,520
Sing a little duet.

524
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:12,920
Come on.

525
00:19:18,280 --> 00:19:19,320
What do you want to sing?

526
00:19:20,200 --> 00:19:21,080
Regular Friends.

527
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:22,200
(That's not right)
No. I'm not singing.

528
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:23,560
Let's just hear it.

529
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:25,000
It's just a song.

530
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:25,800
Just a song.

531
00:19:26,280 --> 00:19:27,840
I need to... Give me a bit.

532
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:29,640
You want to insist on it.

533
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:31,280
I want to challenge it.

534
00:19:31,280 --> 00:19:32,000
Okay.

535
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:32,960
What's this?

536
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:37,040
Four, five, seven, four,
two, four, two, five.

537
00:19:37,040 --> 00:19:38,830
Oh my goodness.

538
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:42,360
This is so hard.

539
00:19:42,960 --> 00:19:43,560
This is...

540
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:44,520
(Thinking)
Four.

541
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:47,960
This is four on the fourth string.

542
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:50,560
Five and seven on the fifth string.

543
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:53,360
This is five, seven, five,
then slide up to seven.

544
00:19:55,920 --> 00:19:56,920
Oh, that's beautiful.

545
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,400
Try it now.

546
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:10,240
What is this?

547
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:11,520
Must be fast.

548
00:20:12,820 --> 00:20:13,980
(Shaking)

549
00:20:14,380 --> 00:20:15,020
(Glances)

550
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:17,280
My fingers hurt.

551
00:20:18,580 --> 00:20:19,420
(Squeezes)

552
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:23,680
That's bad. Forget it.

553
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:24,360
Stop playing.

554
00:20:24,360 --> 00:20:25,240
I can't press on the string.

555
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:25,960
Let me.

556
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,200
This is so tiring.

557
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:29,920
Change the song.

558
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:31,520
It's too hard.

559
00:20:31,520 --> 00:20:33,040
The first song I learned on the guitar

560
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:33,880
was Travel is Meaningful.

561
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:35,960
It's the first song I learned.

562
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:38,520
Did you learn it for the show?

563
00:20:39,320 --> 00:20:41,200
No. My teacher taught me.

564
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:46,040
♪You've seen so many beautiful sights♪

565
00:20:46,040 --> 00:20:48,560
♪You've seen so many beautiful faces♪

566
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:50,760
♪You've lost yourself upon the map♪

567
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:54,040
♪In every fleeting moment of time♪

568
00:20:54,040 --> 00:20:59,640
(Sways)
♪Yet you can't say why you love me♪

569
00:20:59,640 --> 00:21:07,080
♪Nor why you chose to leave♪

570
00:21:24,580 --> 00:21:27,300
♪Morning steam rises
from breakfast stalls♪

571
00:21:27,300 --> 00:21:29,900
♪Packed subway cars,
barely room to breathe♪

572
00:21:29,900 --> 00:21:34,100
♪Still half asleep, another day begins♪

573
00:21:35,260 --> 00:21:37,980
♪The city glows beneath the towers♪

574
00:21:37,980 --> 00:21:40,620
♪Somewhere beyond the clouds,
a sweet little date awaits♪

575
00:21:40,620 --> 00:21:44,700
♪But first,
there are endless meetings to survive♪

576
00:21:45,420 --> 00:21:46,820
♪Even if the fairy tale
only lasts a day♪

577
00:21:46,820 --> 00:21:48,140
♪I'll still give it everything I have♪

578
00:21:48,140 --> 00:21:49,460
♪Love out loud♪

579
00:21:49,460 --> 00:21:50,860
♪Don't let this summer slip away♪

580
00:21:50,860 --> 00:21:52,100
♪Cupid's arrow is already on its way♪

581
00:21:52,100 --> 00:21:53,500
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

582
00:21:53,500 --> 00:21:56,460
♪Just be a little braver♪

583
00:21:56,460 --> 00:21:57,700
♪Keep moving♪

584
00:21:57,820 --> 00:21:59,300
♪Keep moving♪

585
00:21:59,300 --> 00:22:02,660
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

586
00:22:05,020 --> 00:22:07,380
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

587
00:22:17,820 --> 00:22:23,260
♪Keep moving♪

588
00:22:23,260 --> 00:22:25,900
♪Life can be complicated,
yet beautifully simple♪

589
00:22:25,900 --> 00:22:31,260
♪Go discover♪

590
00:22:31,260 --> 00:22:34,660
♪That heartbeat you've been longing
